Short:        Effectful screenblankers for MorphOS
Author:       Stefan Blixth (stefan -at- onyxsoft -dot- se)
Uploader:     stefan onyxsoft se
Type:         util/blank
Version:      1.4
Replaces:     util/blank/fxblankers.lha
Architecture: ppc-morphos;

Effectful screenblankers for MorphOS, based on following demo effects :

* DawaFire    : https://github.com/ezrec/AROS-mirror/tree/ABI_V1/contrib/Demo/DawaFire
* Firework    : https://github.com/ezrec/AROS-mirror/tree/ABI_V1/contrib/Demo/Firework
* Flamme      : https://github.com/ezrec/AROS-mirror/tree/ABI_V1/contrib/Demo/Flamme
* DotFlag     : https://github.com/johangardhage/retro-demoeffects/blob/master/src/dotflag.cpp
* MysticLines : June Tate-Gans from Nybbles and Bytes Mystify QBasic example from the live stream : https://youtu.be/bl0td3qV7WM?t=480
* DotSpiral   : https://github.com/johangardhage/retro-demoeffects/blob/master/src/dottunnel.cpp
* DotTunnel   : https://github.com/root42/dostunnl

What's new (v1.4) :

* Added three new blankers : Mirari, DotSpiral and DotTunnel
